  "findings": [
    "Hellfire visible mesh Z extent is 1.4543548226356506; profile length .52 is a different gameplay field. It must not define the visible rod length. Source mesh width .21770336478948593 and height .28263451159000397 include fins.",
    "Each physical rack contains four missile joints, arranged 0 upper-right, 1 lower-right, 2 lower-left, 3 upper-left in its own coordinates. The authored model recenters these physical joints and preserves their approximately .326 lateral / .270 vertical separation.",
    "Source AI Hellfire user yaw min/max both zero, pitch -180..180, infinite ammunition true. Player Hellfire user pitch/yaw both zero and finite ammunition. Current guided tracking continues after its separate source tracking delay.",
    "BH D1 and D2 share the same skeleton parent and lateral coordinates approximately 2.724 and 1.949987; outboard / inboard ratio informs authored mount separation. Full source absolute body transforms are not copied.",
    "Rapid 70mm and guided Hellfire have distinct source profiles, geometry, firing inputs and effect tracks. Modeling separate rapid pods does not establish their working weapon mechanism."
  ],
